{"id":"ebb018d2e72663e2","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-context-rewrite.md","title":"df-context-rewrite","display":"df-context-rewrite","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","depends_on":["[[56-df-context]]","[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]"],"label":"56-df-context-rewrite","aliases":["56-df-context-rewrite"],"display":"df-context-rewrite","type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fbc74eb888873878\" href=\"?note=fbc74eb888873878\" title=\"56-df-context\">56-df-context</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-context-rewrite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-context-rewrite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-rewrite"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-context-rewrite\"><code>df-context-rewrite</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\">\\(R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>，一洞上下文集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbc74eb888873878\" href=\"?note=fbc74eb888873878\" title=\"56-df-context\">56-df-context</a>。</li>\n<li>一步关系和自反传递闭包分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" href=\"?note=a3b60e1e9cdeef27\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-step\">56-df-rewrite-step</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in T\">\\(s,t\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxStep}_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(C[s],C[t])\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\land s,t\\in T\\land s\\to_R t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CtxStep}_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(C[s],C[t])\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\land s,t\\in T\\land s\\to_R t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxStep}_R=\\to_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CtxStep}_R=\\to_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_R t\\Rightarrow C[s]\\to_R C[t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_R t\\Rightarrow C[s]\\to_R C[t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\to_R^{*}t\\Rightarrow C[s]\\to_R^{*}C[t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\to_R^{*}t\\Rightarrow C[s]\\to_R^{*}C[t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>CtxStep 给出一步关系的上下文闭包。一步相容性直接由两次上下文嵌套仍为一洞上下文得到；恒等上下文 □ 给出反向包含；多步结论对路径长度归纳。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，练习2.3.6，印刷第40页，OCR页块61。本次据用户提供的本地 DjVu 文字层核对陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-context-rewrite","text":"`df-context-rewrite`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-context","status":"resolved","id":"fbc74eb888873878","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-context]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-step]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-context","status":"resolved","id":"fbc74eb888873878","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，一洞上下文集合 $\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$ 见 [[56-df-context]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-step","status":"resolved","id":"a3b60e1e9cdeef27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"一步关系和自反传递闭包分别见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"一步关系和自反传递闭包分别见 [[56-df-rewrite-step]]、[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxStep}_R\\coloneqq\n\\{(C[s],C[t])\\mid C\\in\\operatorname{Ctx}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)\\land s,t\\in T\\land s\\to_R t\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CtxStep}_R=\\to_R.","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_R t\\Rightarrow C[s]\\to_R C[t].","display":true},{"tex":"s\\to_R^{*}t\\Rightarrow C[s]\\to_R^{*}C[t].","display":true}],"bytes":1324,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-context-rewrite.md]]"}],"outgoing":["fbc74eb888873878","a3b60e1e9cdeef27","55c39f44acb2211c"]}